    "notes": {
        "e2f7b79f-7393-43dd-bc13-cb3b615b5c71": {
            "x": 48,
            "y": 480,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Timing\n\nThe trigger watches **Task.Status Equals Completed** (no Field History needed). The flow creates a Task (Not Started), completes it and deletes it after the trigger fired. The trigger reads changes older than 30 seconds and polls every minute, so it fires 1-2 minutes after the update; AfterAll waits up to 10 minutes. The task Subject is the filter, so older test tasks do not interfere."
        }
